@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="py-5 bg-white border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Learn how VMR collects, processes, and protects your corporate data and transaction histories.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container fs-7 text-muted" style="max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mb-3">1. Information Collection</h5>
        <p>We collect essential customer account registration details (Name, business email, mobile numbers, delivery address, tax numbers) to complete checkout dispatches and match corporate profiles inside our SmartERP system.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">2. How We Secure Data</h5>
        <p>Transactions are routed through secure, encrypted network connections. Customer passwords are encrypted using ASP.NET Core Identity hashing protocols, and billing logs are securely managed within SQL Server tables under strict firewalls.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">3. Cookie Policy</h5>
        <p>We utilize HTTP-only cookies to handle security details, track Shopping Cart quantities, manage active Wishlists, and cache recently viewed items. We do not use tracking cookies for third-party advertising.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">4. Information Sharing</h5>
        <p>VMR Power Tools does not rent, sell, or disclose corporate customer databases. Contact details are exclusively shared with registered logistics partners to execute delivery dispatches.</p>
    </div>
</section>
